  "content": "[Intro]\n[Emaj]\n[Abm7]\n[Asus2]\n[B]\n\n[Verse 1]\n[Emaj]I will leave my heart\n[Abm7]at the door I won't\n[Asus2]say a word They've\n[B]all been said before you know So\n[Emaj]why don't we just play\n[Abm7]pretend Like we're not scared\n[Asus2]of what's coming next Or scared\n[B]of having [Ab]nothing left Look\n\n[Pre-Chorus]\n[C#m]don't get me wrong I\n[B]know there is no tomor-\n[F#m]row\n[B7sus4]All I ask is\n\n[Chorus]\n[Emaj]If this is my\n[C#]last night with\n[F#m]you\n[B7sus4]Hold me like I'm more [B]than just a\n[Emaj]friend Give me a\n[C#]memory I can\n[F#m]use\n[B7sus4]Take me by the hand [B]while we\n[E]do what [E/D#]lovers\n[C#m]do It matters how this ends\n[F#m]'Cause\n[B7sus4]what if I never love a-\n\n[Pre-Verse]\n[Emaj]gain?\n[Abm7]\n[Asus2]\n[B]\n\n[Verse 2]\n[Emaj]I don't need your ho-\n[Abm7]nesty It's already in\n[Asus2]your eyes And I'm\n[B]sure my eyes, they speak for me\n[Emaj]No one knows me like\n[Abm7]you do And since you're the on-\n[Asus2]ly one that matters Tell me who\n[B]do I run [Ab]to Look\n\n[Pre-Chorus]\n[C#m]don't get me wrong I\n[B]know there is no tomor-\n[F#m]row\n[B7sus4]All I ask is\n\n[Chorus]\n[Emaj]If this is my\n[C#]last night with\n[F#m]you\n[B7sus4]Hold me like I'm more [B]than just a\n[Emaj]friend Give me a\n[C#]memory I can\n[F#m]use\n[B7sus4]Take me by the hand [B]while we\n[E]do what [E/D#]lovers\n[C#m]do It matters how this ends\n[F#m]'Cause\n[B7sus4]what if I never love again?\n\n[Bridge]\n[E7/D]Let this be our\n[A]lesson in\n[F#m]love Let this be the\n[B7sus4]way we [B]remember\n[Abm7]us I don't wanna be\n[Ab]cruel or vi-\n[C#m]cious And I ain't\n[F#m]asking for forgiveness\n[B7sus4]All I ask [C]is\n\n[Chorus]\n[Fmaj]If this is my\n[D]last night with\n[Gm7]you\n[C7sus4]Hold me like I'm more [C]than just a\n[Fmaj]friend Give me a\n[D]memory I can\n[Gm7]use\n[C7sus4]Take me by the hand [C]while we\n[F]do what [F/E]lovers\n[Dm]do It matters how this ends\n[Gm7]'Cause\n[C7sus4]what if I never love\nag